==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|ig-}}, as in "ignorant", and {{m|en|gnostic||knowing}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who holds to [[ignosticism]].
# One who holds the theory, that the idea of a “God” may exist, but that one cannot answer what he/she believes that may be, until someone describes the term “God”, first.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or relating to ignostics.
# Of or relating to ignosticism.

